@host = http://localhost:5015

### Create user — 201 Created + Location header
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana.petrovic@example.com",
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Petrovic",
  "password": "Sup3rSecret!"
}


### Nevalidan zahtev — 400 ValidationProblem (los email, prazno ime, kratka lozinka)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Petrovic",
  "password": "short"
}
